Error: Jet.MissingCoreRole: No Core function or owned trait fills role `MissingRoleProbe`
  --> <corelib>/Core/Builtins/Builtins.jet:52:5
    |
 52 |     MissingRoleProbe,
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The compiler runs the one Core function, or calls the one Compiler/Prelude/Traits.jet trait, that fills a role, so each role is filled exactly once.
 Fix: Mark the Core function or the Compiler/Prelude/Traits.jet trait that does `MissingRoleProbe` with `#Builtin.Role(.MissingRoleProbe)`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MissingCoreRole
